<title>USA: Kuwait Petroleum retains Goldman to sell Santa Fe.</title>
<headline>Kuwait Petroleum retains Goldman to sell Santa Fe.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Kuwait Petroleum Corp said Thursday it had retained Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co as its financial advisor &quot;to evaluate various strategic options regarding the potential divestiture of all or a substantial portion of its wholly-owned subsidiary, Santa Fe International Corp.</p>
</text>
